{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal restoration failures to the caller.** If `restore.close()` throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` on an asynchronous executor, this still completes `result` with the selected success/PENDING/retry outcome. The fatal reaches only the worker\u2019s uncaught handler, so Lambda can return normally after a fatal failure. Complete `result` exceptionally with the restoration fatal before rethrowing it, and test that the caller receives the same instance.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77JQ9B","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":269,"observation_digest":"166ea186f749de04f75029f1a32778fae0d83728c4b8f204ecfa3754113e4569","observation_id":"aro_v1_czxkdbxxjhpaj52qfhy2gj3y7l","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ypy2y57vtva3tue6ol67lga5xg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2cc073779905eb2b61db09fe0e50e867759edd7a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":266,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_eeimk7r4naz2x3sv5wgjbfdczz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
